93
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,300
No tengamos miedo.

94
00:08:11,270 --> 00:08:12,480
Vamos juntos.

95
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,140
Todos de nuestra familia,

96
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:19,240
