103
00:09:34,510 --> 00:09:38,600
Sr. Yan y Sr. He, acérquense
a verificar las tintas.

104
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,080
¿Qué tal esta vez?

105
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,420
El resultado sigue igual.

106
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,000
Su Alteza,

107
00:10:07,270 --> 00:10:08,550
