193
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,270
Renkichi.

194
00:13:36,150 --> 00:13:38,510
Basta, no digas nada más.

195
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:47,670
Su Alteza.

196
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,650
En la prueba de inmersión de tinta,

197
00:13:50,670 --> 00:13:52,080
la familia Kuroda

198
00:13:52,910 --> 00:13:53,970
admite la derrota.

199
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,780
La tinta de Huizhou de Ming

200
00:14:01,670 --> 00:14:03,440
